  "locales": {
    "en": {
      "trackName": "Momo Watch Games",
      "description": "Momo: Watch Games is a pack of quick games built for your Apple Watch. Each round takes seconds, so you can play while you wait for coffee, the bus, or a meeting to start. No ads.\n\nPUZZLE, REFLEX AND HEAD TO HEAD\nSlide and merge tiles, flip lights, flood a grid with color, and solve Sudoku. Keep a ball inside a ring, stack a wobbly tower, crack the lock, or take on the computer in air hockey, Drop Four, Flip and more. Every game is simple to learn and hard to put down.\n\nBUILT FOR A SMALL SCREEN\nTap, swipe or drag, and turn the Digital Crown if you like. The games are designed for your wrist first, not squeezed down from something bigger.\n\nLEVEL UP AS YOU PLAY\nEvery round earns XP. Build a daily streak, collect bronze to diamond medals in each game, and chase your personal best. After a round you see how your score compares with your best, so you always know if you beat yourself.\n\nMAKE MOMO YOURS\nMomo is your little blue companion. Pick a color, a face and a ring, and Momo shows up on your profile and in your games.\n\nALSO ON IPHONE AND IPAD\nThe watch is where Momo lives, but the same games are on your iPhone and iPad too, for when you want a bigger screen. Sudoku grows from 4x4 up to a full 9x9. Your level, scores and medals are shared across your watch, phone and iPad.\n\nWHAT YOU GET\n- Quick games made for Apple Watch\n- Puzzle, reflex and head to head games, with a computer opponent that gets sharper as you win\n- XP, levels, streaks and medals\n- Your personal best shown after every round\n- A customizable Momo\n- Also on iPhone and iPad, with everything in sync\n- No ads\n\nMade by one person who wanted small, delightful games that are easy on the eyes and easy to put down. I hope Momo makes your day a little lighter.",
      "releaseNotes": "New: Pop, a bubble shooter, Fleet, a Battleship-style game, and Snake. All play on Apple Watch, iPhone and iPad.",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/momo-watch-games/id6829988983?uo=4",
